meta {
  name: Criar admin via Api-Key
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Admin EKS",
    "document": "39053344705",
    "email": "admin.eks@example.com",
    "password": "admin123",
    "role": "ADMIN"
  }
}

docs {
  Preencha `apiKey` com o secret API_KEY do GitHub. Depois altere loginDocument/loginPassword para este admin e rode Login de novo. Catalogo (cliente, peca, servico) costuma exigir ADMIN.
}
